{"Drug":{"value":"http://dbpedia.org/resource/Trospium","type":"uri"},"IntDrug":{"value":"http://www4.wiwiss.fu-berlin.de/drugbank/resource/drugs/DB01278","type":"uri"},"IntEffect":{"value":"The anticholinergic effects of Trospium may be enhanced by Pramlintide. Additive effects of reduced GI motility may occur. Pramlintide slows gastic emptying and should not be used with drugs that alter GI motility (e.g. anticholinergics). Consider alternative treatments or use caution during concomitant therapy.","type":"literal"}},
