{"Drug":{"value":"http://dbpedia.org/resource/Valganciclovir","type":"uri"},"IntDrug":{"value":"http://www4.wiwiss.fu-berlin.de/drugbank/resource/drugs/DB00688","type":"uri"},"IntEffect":{"value":"The excretion rates of Valganciclovir and/or Mycophenolate mofetil may decrease. Monitor for increased serum concentrations and toxicity of both agents.","type":"literal"}},
